OL,3,GNEWSAHe spent years in and out of
OL,4,Aprison - a single book helped change
OL,5,Aeverything
OL,6,
OL,7,F"A book club in prison is the best
OL,8,Fthing on planet Earth, it really is,"
OL,9,Fsays Omar Mentesh, who spent nearly two
OL,10,Fdecades in and out of jail from his
OL,11,Fteenage years.
OL,13,F"It's just people sharing, from all
OL,14,Fwalks of life... and when they're in
OL,15,Fthe book club, they find the book
OL,16,Factually leads the conversation into
OL,17,Fother things. And I think for people
OL,18,Fwho struggle to open up it was great."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
