OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHe spent years in and out of
OL,4,Aprison - a single book helped change
OL,5,Aeverything
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 44-year-old, from South Woodford in
OL,8,Feast London, features in a new BBC
OL,9,Fdocumentary led by Queen Camilla,
OL,10,Fcalled The Book That Changed My Life,
OL,11,Fwhich looks at how reading had a
OL,12,Fprofound impact on five different
OL,13,Fpeople.
OL,15,FFor Mentesh, what began as a means of
OL,16,Fescape became something that would
OL,17,Fchange him forever.
